Output .local/cli-evidence/before/launcher.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 760
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Hide
Type "unset NO_COLOR"
Enter
Type "export TERM=xterm-256color COLORTERM=truecolor"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type ".local/cli-evidence/before/darkpawns --instance .local/cli-evidence/instance status"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type ".local/cli-evidence/before/darkpawns --instance .local/cli-evidence/instance doctor"
Enter
Sleep 3s
